<title>USA: Countrywide Credit completes acquisition.</title>
<headline>Countrywide Credit completes acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>PASADENA, Calif. 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Countrywide Credit Industries Inc said Monday it has completed the acquisition of all of the outstanding common stock of  Leshner Financial Inc.</p>
<p>Countrywide Credit said in a statement it paid 573,990 shares of newly issued common stock worth about $17 million. The price could be increased by up to $2.5 million worth of additional shares if certain performance goals were met over the next five years.</p>
<p>Leshner Financial is a broker-dealer, investment advisor, fund manager and service provider for unaffiliated mutual funds.  The company currently has about $1.1 billion in funds under management and services accounts aggregating over $9 billion for other fund management companies.</p>
</text>
